# The public content folder at the root (site text, forecasts, OSM extracts, AI text, credited photos) is the one data/ directory
# that is committed, file by file: anything else placed in it, and every other data/ directory, stays ignored (raw research data).
!/data/
/data/*
!/data/README.md
!/data/forecasts.json
!/data/content/
!/data/images/
!/data/geo/
!/data/ai/
